    "description": "Xchange Telecom LLC is a Brooklyn-based facilities-based communications platform that provides internet, Ethernet, voice, mobile, SD-WAN, managed Wi-Fi and cloud connectivity through a hybrid fiber and fixed-wireless network. Skywire Networks is the company's operating division and commercial brand rather than a separate investment. NOVA Infrastructure acquired 100% of founder equity through NOVA-Xchange Investco, L.P. on November 28, 2022. NOVA continues to list the platform as a current investment, and no later sale or signed ownership transfer was identified through September 1, 2026. Individual network assets, lender vehicles and passive fund investors remain outside the company boundary.",
